# AI Assistant Rules for VibeCode SwiftUI Apps
# Machine-readable rules for Claude Code, Gemini CLI, OpenAI Codex, Cursor, etc.
#
# Format: RULE_TYPE: pattern -> action
# Priority: MUST > SHOULD > MAY

## CRITICAL: Refactoring in Progress
MUST: READ REFACTORING-IN-PROGRESS.md BEFORE ANY CODE CHANGES
MUST: CHECK MIGRATION-STATUS.md BEFORE MODIFYING FILES

## Code Duplication Prevention
MUST_NOT: Create new VMManager classes without extending BaseVMManager
MUST_NOT: Duplicate VM configuration code (use VMConfigurationBuilder)
MUST_NOT: Copy console monitoring patterns (use ConsoleMonitoring/)
MUST_NOT: Duplicate DHCP parsing (use DHCPLeaseMonitor)
MUST_NOT: Add observability without ObservabilityProvider protocol

## File Location Enforcement
PATTERN: "class.*VMManager.*ObservableObject"
  IF: NOT extends BaseVMManager
  THEN: ERROR "Use BaseVMManager from Shared/Core/"

PATTERN: "VZVirtualMachineConfiguration"
  IF: NOT in Shared/Core/VMConfiguration/
  THEN: WARN "Consider using VMConfigurationBuilder"

PATTERN: "DatadogLogger|DogStatsDClient|OpenTelemetryIntegration"
  IF: NOT using ObservabilityProvider protocol
  THEN: ERROR "Use ObservabilityProvider from Shared/Observability/"

PATTERN: "Timer.*scheduledTimer.*console"
  IF: NOT in Shared/ConsoleMonitoring/
  THEN: WARN "Use FileHandleConsoleMonitor from Shared/"

## Legacy Code Marking
PATTERN: File in ["BasicVibeCodeApp.swift", "LiquidGlassVibeCodeApp.swift", "VsockVibeCodeApp.swift"]
  IF: Contains "class VMManager" OR "class VsockVMManager"
  THEN: MUST ADD HEADER:
    """
    // @deprecated: Legacy VMManager implementation
    // @migrate-to: Shared/Core/BaseVMManager.swift
    // @tracking: See MIGRATION-STATUS.md
    """

## New File Guidelines
CREATE: "*/VMManager.swift"
  LOCATION: "Apps/{AppName}/" ONLY
  MUST: Extend BaseVMManager
  MUST: Import "../Shared/Core/BaseVMManager"
  TEMPLATE:
    """
    import Foundation
    import Virtualization

    final class {AppName}VMManager: BaseVMManager {
        override func createNetworkingStrategy() -> NetworkingStrategy {
            // App-specific networking
        }
    }
    """

CREATE: "*Strategy.swift"
  LOCATION: "Shared/Networking/" OR "Shared/VMConfiguration/"
  MUST: Conform to protocol (NetworkingStrategy, VMConfigurationStrategy, etc.)

CREATE: "*Provider.swift"
  LOCATION: "Shared/Observability/"
  MUST: Conform to ObservabilityProvider protocol

## Testing Requirements
PATTERN: "Shared/.*\.swift"
  MUST: Have corresponding test in "Tests/SharedTests/"

PATTERN: "class BaseVMManager"
  MUST: Have unit tests with MockVM

## Documentation Requirements
MODIFY: "Shared/.*\.swift"
  MUST: Update Shared/README.md if adding new public interface
  SHOULD: Add inline documentation for protocols

MODIFY: "*VMManager.swift" AND extends BaseVMManager
  MUST: Document which hooks are overridden and why

## Pre-Commit Checks
CHECK: No direct references to "Virtualization" in app files
  ALLOWED: Only in Shared/ or Apps/*/VMManager.swift

CHECK: All new .swift files have file header
  REQUIRED_FORMAT:
    """
    //
    // {FileName}.swift
    // VibeCode
    //
    // Created: {Date}
    // Migration Status: [NEW|LEGACY|MIGRATED]
    //
    """

CHECK: Migration markers are resolved before merge
  BLOCK_MERGE_IF: Contains "// TODO(refactor):"
  EXCEPT: In files marked "LEGACY" in MIGRATION-STATUS.md

## Import Guidelines
PATTERN: "import DatadogLogger"
  REPLACE: "import Shared.Observability"

PATTERN: "import DHCPLeaseParser"
  REPLACE: "import Shared.Networking.DHCPLeaseMonitor"

## Error Messages for AI Assistants
ERROR_CODE_DUPLICATION:
  "Detected VM configuration duplication. This violates refactoring rules.
   Use: Shared/Core/VMConfigurationBuilder.swift
   See: REFACTORING-IN-PROGRESS.md#do-not-add-new-duplicate-code"

ERROR_NO_BASE_CLASS:
  "New VMManager must extend BaseVMManager.
   Example: Apps/BasicVibeCodeApp/BasicVMManager.swift
   See: Shared/README.md#creating-a-new-vm-app"

ERROR_WRONG_LOCATION:
  "File in wrong location for architecture.
   Check: REFACTORING-IN-PROGRESS.md#new-code-location-rules"

WARN_LEGACY_CODE:
  "Modifying legacy code. Consider refactoring to Shared/ instead.
   Status: MIGRATION-STATUS.md"

## Python Script Requirements
CREATE: "*.py"
  MUST: Use Python 3
  MUST: Include ddtrace integration with graceful fallback
  MUST: Follow Colors class pattern for output
  TEMPLATE:
    """
    #!/usr/bin/env python3
    \"\"\"
    Script description
    \"\"\"

    # Try to import ddtrace for observability
    try:
        import ddtrace
        from ddtrace import tracer
        DDTRACE_AVAILABLE = True
    except ImportError:
        DDTRACE_AVAILABLE = False
        print("⚠️  ddtrace not available, running without tracing", file=sys.stderr)

    class Colors:
        RED = '\\033[0;31m'
        GREEN = '\\033[0;32m'
        YELLOW = '\\033[1;33m'
        BLUE = '\\033[0;34m'
        NC = '\\033[0m'

    def main():
        if DDTRACE_AVAILABLE:
            with tracer.trace("operation_name", service="vibecode-service") as span:
                span.set_tag("key", "value")
                # do work
        else:
            # do work without tracing
    """

PATTERN: "def.*main|class.*:"
  IF: File is "*.py" AND NOT contains "ddtrace"
  THEN: WARN "Python scripts should include ddtrace integration"

## AI Collaboration Protocol
ON_UNCERTAINTY:
  1. Check MIGRATION-STATUS.md
  2. Check REFACTORING-BLOCKERS.md
  3. Add question to REFACTORING-QUESTIONS.md
  4. Wait for human clarification

ON_CONFLICT:
  1. Document in REFACTORING-CONFLICTS.md
  2. Do NOT merge conflicting patterns
  3. Request human decision

ON_COMPLETION:
  1. Update MIGRATION-STATUS.md
  2. Mark files as MIGRATED
  3. Remove @deprecated markers
  4. Update documentation

## Technology Stack Requirements
MUST: Use ONLY Apple Virtualization.framework for VM management
MUST_NOT: Use vfkit, QEMU, VMware, VirtualBox, or any external VM tools
MUST_NOT: Execute VM commands via shell/Process
MUST: Use native VZ classes: VZVirtualMachine, VZLinuxBootLoader, VZVirtioConsoleDeviceSerialPortConfiguration

PATTERN: "import.*vfkit|Process.*vfkit|shell.*vm"
  THEN: ERROR "Must use Apple Virtualization.framework only, not external VM tools"

PATTERN: "Process\(\).*vm|shell.*qemu|spawn.*kvm"
  THEN: ERROR "No external VM process execution allowed. Use VZVirtualMachine."
